# ==============================================================================
# GP-V4 Environment Configuration Template (Phase 1: Zero-Config Architecture)
# ==============================================================================
# ZERO-CONFIG DEV / TEST:
# GP-V4 boots and runs completely without any required environment variables.
# All operational settings (Account Capital, Risk Limits, Scanner Interval,
# Market Filters, AI Parameters, Execution Slippage/Spread) are managed
# dynamically via Dashboard Settings (GET/POST /api/settings) with NO restart.
#
# ONLY GENUINE SECRETS / CREDENTIALS BELOW ARE ENVIRONMENT-BASED (OPTIONAL):
# Leave blank during DEV/TEST. The app will gracefully report unavailable
# external services rather than crashing.
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Market Data Provider Secret (Optional - Biquiti)
# BIQUITI_API_KEY=

# 2. AI Provider Secret (Optional - Novita AI / Gemini / DeepSeek)
# NOVITA_API_KEY=
# AI_API_KEY=

# 3. Persistence Secret (Optional - Supabase)
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=

# 4. Telegram Bot Secret (Optional - Telegram Notifier)
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=

# ==============================================================================
# All other configuration is controlled directly from the Trading Terminal:
# Settings -> Account Capital, Risk Engine, Scanner, Filters, AI, Execution
# ==============================================================================
